37632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/c8e36a3431feae62b50f7a94a1b30d1c.mp4?t=1685637632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It helps to have a ray gun</h2><br>No mysterious alien planet is complete without some hostile baddies eager to ruin your day. Confront them head-on, or dodge them with some crafty cross-dimensional footwork.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/12492fa94ab35bc69e0923cb05aa2541.poster.avif?t=1685637632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/12492fa94ab35bc69e0923cb05aa2541.webm?t=1685637632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/12492fa94ab35bc69e0923cb05aa2541.mp4?t=1685637632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a lush, mysterious world</h2><br>Each of Stereo Boy\u2019s 50+ levels is a unique puzzle box, forming an experience that\u2019s equal parts challenging, meditative, and charming. Collect shards to unlock bonus levels and discover the tragic (and sometimes hilarious) story behind SO-671\u2019s lost civilization.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/9d3edefc66dd3fdead9f66a5c31dff59.poster.avif?t=1685637632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/9d3edefc66dd3fdead9f66a5c31dff59.webm?t=1685637632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073530/extras/9d3edefc66dd3fdead9f66a5c31dff59.mp4?t=1685637632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>"